  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Trace-morphology teaching concept showing one shallow almond-shaped negative resting impression with pointed ends in an interpretive sediment crop. Not a shell, body fossil, named tracemaker or copied excavated specimen. Nominal 20 cm crop span, relief and palette are artistic choices; the crop is not an inferred organism size.",
    "zh": "遗迹形态教学概念：示意沉积裁片内的一处浅杏仁状负型停栖凹印，两端尖收。不是贝壳、实体化石、指定造迹者或出土标本复制；名义20厘米裁片跨度、凹凸及配色属美术选择，裁片大小不代表生物体尺寸。"
  },
